WEBVTT

00:10.960 --> 00:12.710
This is how I'll become...

00:15.750 --> 00:17.460
This is how I'll become...

00:19.630 --> 00:21.250
...Supreme Commander.

00:21.710 --> 00:22.880
...a hero.

00:23.420 --> 00:25.000
This is my story!

01:56.580 --> 02:00.330
<b>Promise, Nei, Remember</b>

01:59.420 --> 02:00.920
Give you Yuuki?

02:00.920 --> 02:01.880
That's right.

02:01.880 --> 02:04.130
I want him for the 6th Squadron.

02:04.460 --> 02:07.580
I've excelled at academics
ever since I was young,

02:07.580 --> 02:09.580
and my rank reflects that.

02:09.580 --> 02:11.670
It's been smooth sailing,

02:11.670 --> 02:14.670
but you might say
my personal life is a bit dull...

02:16.040 --> 02:17.960
I'm in need of a pet.

02:17.960 --> 02:20.500
A boy who helps me
relax after a hard day's work.

02:20.500 --> 02:22.830
A boy who makes me happy.

02:24.460 --> 02:28.080
If you're willing to be flexible
and hand the little slave over...

02:28.080 --> 02:32.460
I'd be willing to endorse you in the
next Supreme Commander election.

02:37.920 --> 02:40.790
I'm going to become
Supreme Commander on my own.

02:40.790 --> 02:42.880
Not by leveraging one of my inferiors.

02:43.040 --> 02:44.290
Oh dear...

02:44.290 --> 02:46.420
Our meeting is over, yes?

02:46.420 --> 02:49.250
What about dating the little slave
in my free time?

02:53.580 --> 02:54.580
Huh?!

02:54.580 --> 02:57.040
Miss Tenka said she wants ME?!

02:57.040 --> 03:00.000
Yup. Seems she's intent
on finding a companion.

03:00.000 --> 03:02.710
A companion? So she wants a pet.

03:02.710 --> 03:05.210
Yeah, that's exactly how she put it.

03:05.210 --> 03:06.380
A pet...?

03:06.380 --> 03:08.130
O-okay, but...

03:08.130 --> 03:10.540
I'm busy being
the 7th Squadron's caretaker!

03:10.540 --> 03:12.130
See? You get it.

03:12.130 --> 03:14.710
The 7th Squadron does need you.

03:14.710 --> 03:16.460
But like I told Tenka...

03:16.460 --> 03:19.170
I have no control over your personal life.

03:19.170 --> 03:20.330
Right...

03:22.330 --> 03:23.540
The problem is...

03:24.380 --> 03:27.710
I don't really have
a whole lot of free time...

03:29.710 --> 03:30.670
Himarin, you lost weight!

03:30.670 --> 03:31.380
Did I?!

03:31.380 --> 03:32.630
C'mon, lemme have a squeeze!

03:32.210 --> 03:34.630
<b>Bath in progress</b>

03:32.210 --> 03:34.630
<b>No boys allowed!!</b>

03:32.210 --> 03:34.630
<b>Stay in your room!!</b>

03:32.630 --> 03:33.630
No way!

03:41.880 --> 03:43.380
I'm exhausted...

03:44.920 --> 03:47.210
Miss Tenka, huh?

03:47.790 --> 03:52.080
It makes me happy to hear a gorgeous woman
like her say she wants me...

03:53.000 --> 03:55.130
But I'm supposed to be a hero.

03:55.130 --> 03:56.670
Not a pet.

03:58.960 --> 03:59.880
Hiya.

03:59.880 --> 04:00.830
Miss Tenka?!

04:01.080 --> 04:03.040
Shh...

04:05.290 --> 04:08.130
I snuck away to come see you.

04:08.130 --> 04:09.750
For a personal visit.

04:10.460 --> 04:12.080
A-as in...

04:12.080 --> 04:14.460
Kyou told you, didn't she?

04:14.460 --> 04:16.500
That I have a crush on you.

04:21.040 --> 04:24.170
I was hoping... you might like
to be my boyfriend.

04:24.170 --> 04:25.500
Boyfriend?

04:25.500 --> 04:27.380
Not a lackey or a pet?!

04:27.380 --> 04:29.540
Nope. A normal relationship.

04:29.920 --> 04:33.420
"Pet" was just a figure of speech.
Since you're so adorable.

04:33.960 --> 04:37.130
The ardent slave, devoted to his master...

04:37.250 --> 04:38.920
Your bravery won me over.

04:42.670 --> 04:45.210
And let's not forget your
impressive housekeeping skills.

04:45.500 --> 04:47.380
Right now, I see you as more of

04:47.380 --> 04:50.380
a delightful little pet
because you're young and cute.

04:53.670 --> 04:56.960
But if you grow up big and strong...

04:56.960 --> 04:58.580
I might just spoil you.

05:09.290 --> 05:11.880
This... makes my heart race.

05:11.880 --> 05:14.460
I've never felt anything like it.

05:25.880 --> 05:28.420
I had wanted to do this the right way...

05:29.170 --> 05:32.920
but I don't think
I can resist you any longer...

05:32.920 --> 05:34.540
M-Miss Tenka?!

05:36.540 --> 05:37.210
Wait-

05:37.210 --> 05:39.880
Relax. I'm just going
to take off your clothes.

05:39.880 --> 05:41.250
I CAN'T relax!

05:41.500 --> 05:45.420
Speaking of which, is the shirt
you're wearing important to you?

05:46.210 --> 05:49.250
N-no, it's just a cheap old t-shirt...

05:50.710 --> 05:52.000
Boop.

05:52.000 --> 05:53.330
Ame-no-mitori.

05:55.290 --> 05:57.670
That's abusing your ability!

05:58.670 --> 05:59.500
Come on...

06:00.130 --> 06:04.210
Can't you at least tell me
whether you'll go out with me or not?

06:04.710 --> 06:07.420
One: "I accept your proposal."

06:08.000 --> 06:10.880
Two: "I need time to mull it over."

06:10.880 --> 06:12.880
Three: "I decline."

06:15.130 --> 06:17.710
Option two!
Two, two, two, two, two!

06:17.710 --> 06:20.710
I see... It was a bit too sudden, huh?

06:20.710 --> 06:23.380
So it's not necessarily a "no."

06:23.380 --> 06:24.250
Huh?!

06:24.500 --> 06:28.500
Which makes me think I should do something
to keep you from slipping away.

06:30.290 --> 06:32.710
Yukki! Let's play video games!

06:37.830 --> 06:40.830
WHAT?!

06:46.710 --> 06:48.960
You pounced on him out of nowhere.

06:48.960 --> 06:51.040
When did you get so aggressive?

06:51.040 --> 06:53.580
I must've been under
the little slave's spell...

06:53.580 --> 06:54.750
How indecent...

06:54.750 --> 06:56.460
Hmph...

06:56.460 --> 06:59.790
I know I said that I wouldn't interfere
in your personal life, but-

06:59.790 --> 07:01.330
Oh, oh! Pick me!

07:01.330 --> 07:03.750
Sneaking into another squad's dorm
in the middle of the night

07:03.750 --> 07:06.210
is totally inconsiderate,
regardless of the circumstances!

07:06.210 --> 07:08.170
It's immoral behavior!

07:08.170 --> 07:10.580
And we should never abuse our abilities!

07:10.580 --> 07:11.710
There you have it.

07:11.710 --> 07:12.670
Point taken.

07:14.420 --> 07:15.500
Dismissed.

07:15.500 --> 07:17.130
And go home already.

07:17.130 --> 07:18.290
'Kay!

07:20.880 --> 07:23.130
Catch you later, little slave.

07:23.130 --> 07:25.420
Grr...

07:31.040 --> 07:32.380
I'm worn out...

07:33.130 --> 07:35.040
Early morning practice tomorrow.

07:35.040 --> 07:36.330
Don't be late.

07:37.250 --> 07:38.250
Yes, ma'am!

07:47.250 --> 07:48.460
Lend it out?

07:48.920 --> 07:51.750
Today, in preparation for our battle
against the humanoid Shuuki,

07:51.750 --> 07:54.920
I'd like to try "lending"
my Slave ability.

07:55.170 --> 07:59.210
It would enable the two of you
to ride Yuuki in his Slave form.

07:59.210 --> 08:03.920
If I had to guess, his attributes probably
change based on who's riding him.

08:04.330 --> 08:05.880
That's right...

08:05.880 --> 08:08.380
He didn't look the same when I rode him.

08:09.130 --> 08:11.170
And depending on those attributes,

08:11.170 --> 08:14.580
it would expand the list of strategic
tools and techniques available to us.

08:14.580 --> 08:15.580
Makes sense!

08:15.580 --> 08:17.920
Combining our abilities
with the commander's?

08:17.920 --> 08:19.330
Sounds like fun!

08:19.330 --> 08:21.500
You're up first, Nei. Give it a shot.

08:21.500 --> 08:22.540
Okay!

08:24.290 --> 08:26.790
Um, I might have to step on your back.

08:26.790 --> 08:28.500
Oh, don't worry about it!

08:32.170 --> 08:34.130
Nei, grab the chains.

09:01.710 --> 09:03.630
<b>ETERNAL CHAINS: SLAVE</b>

09:01.710 --> 09:03.630
<b>SHINING STAR</b>

09:03.920 --> 09:06.130
Another form that's different
from Himarin's!

09:06.130 --> 09:07.790
This might actually work!

09:07.790 --> 09:08.750
Yeah.

09:11.670 --> 09:14.420
What do you think, Yuuki?
How is Nei's version?

09:14.420 --> 09:16.500
I'd have to move around first...

09:16.500 --> 09:18.540
Nei, can I test it out?

09:18.540 --> 09:21.540
Do whatever you need to!
I'm holding on tight!

09:34.040 --> 09:35.710
I don't feel as strong...

09:36.830 --> 09:39.920
And you move a lot slower
than in Whirlwind mode.

09:40.250 --> 09:44.080
But on the other hand,
my senses feel sharper than ever before.

09:44.080 --> 09:45.750
My eyesight AND my hearing.

09:45.750 --> 09:48.170
Oh, like for scouting!

09:48.330 --> 09:51.920
If I use my Brand Break trick
and channel energy into my eyes,

09:51.920 --> 09:54.130
I can probably see even...

10:02.580 --> 10:05.330
I-I'M SEEING SOMETHING I REALLY SHOULDN'T!

10:05.330 --> 10:06.330
I'M SORRY!

10:09.540 --> 10:11.500
You can see through stuff?!

10:11.500 --> 10:12.710
Oh no!

10:12.710 --> 10:15.210
Wait, now I can see your backside!

10:15.210 --> 10:17.710
Mr. Yuuki, just face the other direction!

10:17.710 --> 10:20.040
Hurry, turn around!
Good idea! You're smart, Nei!<b></b>

10:20.040 --> 10:20.750
X-ray vision...

10:20.750 --> 10:21.210
I swear I'm not looking anymore!
X-ray vision...<b></b>

10:21.210 --> 10:23.420
I swear I'm not looking anymore!
That means it enhanced his eyesight.<b></b>

10:23.920 --> 10:27.580
An attribute like that could be used
to sniff out hidden Shuuki...

10:28.710 --> 10:29.960
But...

10:30.670 --> 10:32.460
it takes a heavy toll.

10:32.460 --> 10:34.710
Unlike Himari's Learning,

10:34.710 --> 10:38.210
lending my ability saps a
considerable amount of my strength.

10:47.460 --> 10:48.380
Mwah!

10:51.330 --> 10:52.330
Nei?!

10:52.790 --> 10:54.540
Well done, Mr. Yuuki!

10:57.380 --> 10:59.250
What?! I'm so sorry!

10:59.250 --> 11:02.250
M-my body just started moving on its own!

11:03.250 --> 11:05.580
No, no! It's alright!

11:06.420 --> 11:08.710
So the one responsible for paying
an equal price is the borrower,

11:08.710 --> 11:10.170
not the lender.

11:11.080 --> 11:12.210
Forgive me.

11:13.170 --> 11:15.580
I incorrectly assumed I would be
in charge of his compensation

11:15.580 --> 11:16.920
while lending my ability.

11:17.540 --> 11:18.880
I-it's okay!

11:21.500 --> 11:23.130
Oh, I get it!

11:21.670 --> 11:23.580
<b>Ding-ding!</b>

11:26.420 --> 11:30.080
Now it's my turn to test out
Yukki's different forms!

11:30.080 --> 11:31.380
Are you positive?

11:31.380 --> 11:33.880
It's highly likely
that you'll engage in battle.

11:33.880 --> 11:35.420
In the event of a full-blown fight,

11:35.420 --> 11:38.250
your reward may end up being
more extreme than Nei's.

11:40.210 --> 11:41.290
Extreme?!

11:42.170 --> 11:43.580
Well, well...

11:43.580 --> 11:45.750
Time for your hard-earned reward.

11:46.750 --> 11:49.290
Is this the kind of thing you like?

11:49.290 --> 11:52.080
You're such a naughty boy, Yukki...

11:52.540 --> 11:53.750
Ready when you are.

11:54.540 --> 11:55.960
Sure you can handle it?

11:55.960 --> 11:57.170
I'll be fine!

11:57.170 --> 11:59.540
Exterminating Shuuki is the
Demon Defense Force's job!

11:59.540 --> 12:01.380
A silly reward won't stop me!

12:01.380 --> 12:03.170
Solid answer. Hop on.

12:03.420 --> 12:04.460
'Kay!

12:06.130 --> 12:08.580
Shushu Suruga takes the reins!

12:08.580 --> 12:09.880
That was cool!

12:09.880 --> 12:11.460
She looks totally hyped!

12:11.460 --> 12:14.670
C'mon, Yukki!
Let's give you some Shushu flair!

12:14.670 --> 12:15.960
Hya!

12:17.080 --> 12:18.250
Yeah!

12:28.540 --> 12:30.250
<b>ETERNAL CHAINS: SLAVE</b>

12:28.540 --> 12:30.250
<b>IWATOOSHI</b>

12:31.790 --> 12:34.170
I feel insanely strong...

12:34.170 --> 12:36.580
but also sluggish compared to before.

12:36.580 --> 12:38.000
You look bulkier, too.

12:38.000 --> 12:40.380
I'll admit, he is powerful.

12:40.380 --> 12:43.460
But I don't think it's worth lending
my ability for such a simple upgrade.

12:43.460 --> 12:45.580
H-hold on, let's not be hasty!

12:45.580 --> 12:47.130
If I turned myself huge,

12:47.130 --> 12:50.380
there's a pretty good chance that
Yukki would get bigger along with me!

12:50.380 --> 12:51.710
Wait, is that true?

12:51.710 --> 12:53.830
Heroes are always hulkin' out, right?!

12:53.830 --> 12:55.250
Just have a little faith!

12:55.250 --> 12:56.630
All right!

12:57.330 --> 12:58.920
Paradigm Shift!

12:58.920 --> 13:00.580
<b>PARADIGM SHIFT</b>

13:01.500 --> 13:03.080
<b>Gloom</b>

13:08.500 --> 13:10.460
Here's your reward...

13:10.460 --> 13:12.040
It looks like we won't be

13:12.040 --> 13:15.210
utilizing your version of Slave
in combat anytime soon, Shushu.

13:15.210 --> 13:16.210
I know...

13:16.210 --> 13:19.290
Um, Miss Kyouka? Will you be okay?

13:19.290 --> 13:20.290
Yes.

13:20.290 --> 13:23.040
Though I'll need
to get used to it as well.

13:23.040 --> 13:26.880
For now, we'll prioritize your attributes
with Nei as your rider.

13:26.880 --> 13:28.040
Okay...

13:30.960 --> 13:32.460
Nei, time to go.

13:32.460 --> 13:35.710
Oh, school!
I'd better hurry and get changed!

13:40.130 --> 13:41.210
Come to think of it,

13:41.210 --> 13:44.500
I wonder why Nei joined the
Demon Defense Force in the first place...

13:47.500 --> 13:49.500
Okey-dokey, I'm off!

13:49.500 --> 13:51.210
All right. Be careful.

13:52.290 --> 13:55.580
Would you mind if I walked Nei to school?

13:56.330 --> 13:58.460
I'd like to talk to her.

13:59.750 --> 14:00.920
Permission granted.

14:01.080 --> 14:04.210
<b>Reserved for Demon Defense Force Members</b>

14:01.290 --> 14:03.790
She's your superior, so get to know her.

14:12.210 --> 14:14.330
Sorry, I know you're busy...

14:14.750 --> 14:17.500
Don't worry about me, Nei.

14:20.500 --> 14:24.420
<b>Kochi</b>

14:20.500 --> 14:24.420
<b>Passage</b>

14:28.630 --> 14:31.170
You want to know why I joined?

14:31.170 --> 14:33.040
Yeah, it's just...

14:33.040 --> 14:37.170
It must be tough going to school and
working for the Demon Defense Force.

14:37.170 --> 14:39.710
Not having school every day does help.

14:40.290 --> 14:43.790
Plus, the Demon Defense Force
is a worthwhile cause.

14:44.040 --> 14:47.040
Since I might end up finding my parents.

14:47.040 --> 14:48.000
Huh?

14:48.000 --> 14:54.250
One day, out of the blue,
Nei's mother and father went missing...

14:54.790 --> 14:57.420
All signs pointed to a Mato Mishap.

14:58.330 --> 15:00.460
You lost your family, too...

15:02.580 --> 15:06.630
Mr. Yuuki, you've heard the rumors
floating around, haven't you?

15:06.630 --> 15:10.040
Of people receiving
phone calls from relatives

15:10.040 --> 15:14.420
who supposedly vanished in Mato Mishaps,
or catching glimpses of them...

15:14.960 --> 15:17.670
I hear stories like that sometimes.

15:18.040 --> 15:21.500
So, the reason you joined the
Demon Defense Force was...

15:22.080 --> 15:26.000
When I ate a Peach and gained
my clairvoyant powers...

15:26.000 --> 15:29.420
I think Nei's feelings manifested
as her ability.

15:30.330 --> 15:31.710
Ah.

15:31.710 --> 15:34.040
Hence, the name of your ability...

15:35.500 --> 15:38.790
"Sure to Find: Promise."

15:41.750 --> 15:43.420
I'm sure they're alive.

15:43.420 --> 15:46.750
Just like I believe my big sister's
still out there somewhere.

15:46.750 --> 15:47.880
Yeah!

15:55.710 --> 15:57.880
A message from the Supreme Commander?

15:57.880 --> 15:58.750
Yup.

15:58.750 --> 16:01.130
Even if we locate the humanoid Shuuki,

16:01.130 --> 16:04.080
we aren't to engage them
until she gives the order.

16:04.500 --> 16:07.790
Seems like her goal is to create
a dialogue with the humanoids.

16:07.790 --> 16:10.790
I think she wants to assess
how intelligent they are.

16:11.250 --> 16:14.330
They're the type to attack first
and ask questions never.

16:14.790 --> 16:17.420
If all goes well, she believes we could
uncover the mysteries of Mato,

16:17.420 --> 16:22.380
solve the Shuuki problem,
and prevent Mato Mishaps.

16:23.580 --> 16:25.460
Wishful thinking at best.

16:25.460 --> 16:28.960
"I intend to gather all commanders
for a meeting sometime soon.

16:28.960 --> 16:31.380
You may present your opinion then."

16:32.330 --> 16:35.500
I highly doubt the Shuuki
are going to respond to a summons...

16:35.500 --> 16:39.380
Well, it would probably
devolve into a battle anyway.

16:40.420 --> 16:44.880
The 6th Squadron promises its
full cooperation to the 7th Squadron.

16:45.330 --> 16:47.080
I like that look.

16:50.080 --> 16:51.750
We're home!

16:53.460 --> 16:54.580
Hiya.

16:54.920 --> 16:56.290
Welcome back!

16:56.290 --> 16:59.250
Sorry, but can you grab
some water for Tenka?

16:59.250 --> 17:00.710
S-sure!

17:08.500 --> 17:09.750
Whoopsie.

17:12.380 --> 17:13.710
Sorry about that.

17:14.670 --> 17:16.460
Didn't mean to tease you...

17:16.460 --> 17:17.670
It's fine...

17:20.290 --> 17:21.420
Tenka...

17:21.420 --> 17:23.500
You're not really drunk, are you?

17:23.500 --> 17:25.040
Shall we test that theory?

17:25.040 --> 17:26.830
By doing what?!

17:26.830 --> 17:27.880
Uh-oh...

17:27.880 --> 17:30.790
Nei gets the feeling she
shouldn't watch any of this...

17:33.960 --> 17:34.830
Yuu-

17:46.130 --> 17:48.880
Confirmed the appearance of
numerous gateways while on patrol.

17:49.130 --> 17:51.750
Coordinates confirmed.
Help is on the way!

17:51.750 --> 17:52.830
Sounds good!

17:53.630 --> 17:55.040
We're heading out, Yuuki.

17:55.040 --> 17:56.000
Roger!

17:56.000 --> 17:57.040
I'll drop you off.

17:58.790 --> 17:59.960
Please do.

18:07.920 --> 18:10.170
Commander! And... Miss Tenka?!

18:10.630 --> 18:11.880
Shall I assist?

18:11.880 --> 18:12.750
No.

18:12.750 --> 18:14.630
This area is under our jurisdiction.

18:14.630 --> 18:16.080
Stand back and let us handle it.

18:16.500 --> 18:18.920
'Kay, little slave. Good luck.

18:18.920 --> 18:20.790
O-oh, uh... thanks!

18:20.790 --> 18:21.750
Let's move!

18:21.960 --> 18:23.040
Yes, ma'am!

18:25.710 --> 18:29.540
I-it kinda seems like Miss Kyouka's
in a bad mood...

18:33.830 --> 18:37.580
Listen, I know I said that I wouldn't
interfere in your personal life,

18:37.580 --> 18:38.880
but I take it back.

18:38.880 --> 18:39.830
Huh?

18:40.500 --> 18:43.290
No more fawning over
another squad's commander!

18:45.710 --> 18:46.960
At the end of the day...

18:48.170 --> 18:50.420
you're MY slave.

18:51.790 --> 18:52.880
Got it!

19:00.920 --> 19:04.250
Looks like you're in need
of harsher disciplinary methods.

19:04.250 --> 19:05.250
Huh?!

19:21.540 --> 19:23.080
Now let's beat the crap out of 'em!

19:23.080 --> 19:23.920
Roger!

19:26.710 --> 19:27.960
Whoa...

19:41.380 --> 19:42.290
Gotcha!

19:42.290 --> 19:43.750
A new type?!

19:45.500 --> 19:48.080
Huh, you don't see that every day.

19:58.960 --> 20:00.250
It's tough!

20:00.250 --> 20:01.830
And it regenerates quickly...

20:03.500 --> 20:04.880
Let's put it to the test!

20:04.880 --> 20:05.540
Yes, ma'am!

20:09.330 --> 20:11.040
It's time to bow down!

20:18.380 --> 20:20.330
Mighty Blade Cross!

20:18.540 --> 20:20.290
<b>MIGHTY</b>

20:18.540 --> 20:20.290
<b>BLADE</b>

20:18.540 --> 20:20.290
<b>CROSS</b>

20:27.250 --> 20:29.380
Aw, an insta-kill.

20:29.670 --> 20:34.540
I guess augmented Shuuki are good
in theory but not so much in practice...

20:34.880 --> 20:36.500
What are you up to?

20:36.500 --> 20:39.710
Isn't it obvious? I'm playing with them!

20:39.710 --> 20:43.250
Humans like combining
and modifying stuff too, don't they?

20:43.250 --> 20:47.210
But having that level of durability
is basically useless.

20:47.630 --> 20:51.170
I'll never understand what's going on
in that head of yours.

20:51.170 --> 20:53.790
What should I try next?

20:59.460 --> 21:00.750
It's over.

21:02.170 --> 21:03.790
When I transformed...

21:04.920 --> 21:08.380
you gave me a real earful,
and it hyped me up!

21:10.210 --> 21:11.380
Oh yeah?

21:24.710 --> 21:26.130
Little slave...

21:26.130 --> 21:29.540
You truly are a slave at heart,
aren't you?

21:29.540 --> 21:31.920
It only makes me like you more.

21:31.920 --> 21:36.000
I don't think my personal life
is going to be as dull from now on...

23:11.000 --> 23:15.000
<b>TEACH US! NEI-SENPAI!</b>

23:11.290 --> 23:12.920
"Teach Us! Nei-senpai!"

23:12.920 --> 23:15.170
Okey-dokey!
We have a guest joining us today!

23:15.170 --> 23:17.830
I'm Ginna Bizen of the 10th Squadron!
You're totally in for a treat!

23:17.830 --> 23:19.000
Let's discuss Lady Ten's-

23:19.000 --> 23:21.750
Ahem, Commander Tenka Izumo's ability:
Ame-no-Mitori!

23:19.500 --> 23:21.710
<b>AME-NO-MITORI</b>

23:21.750 --> 23:24.210
It's a totally convenient spatial
manipulation ability that allows her

23:24.210 --> 23:26.330
to teleport anywhere
within a 50-kilometer radius.

23:26.460 --> 23:28.250
In combat, she can rip apart
the fabric of space

23:28.250 --> 23:30.170
and wipe out an entire army
in the blink of an eye!

23:30.170 --> 23:32.170
Isn't Lady Ten, like, totally awesome?!

23:32.170 --> 23:34.460
Lady Ten hails from Shimane Prefecture,
and her hobbies include asset management.

23:34.460 --> 23:35.250
Almond cake is her favorite-

23:35.250 --> 23:37.130
Um, we're running out of time, so...

23:37.130 --> 23:39.210
Next time: "Reunion, Coco, Lick"

23:37.500 --> 23:40.960
<b>REUNION,</b>

23:37.500 --> 23:40.960
<b>COCO,</b>

23:37.500 --> 23:40.960
<b>LICK</b>

23:39.210 --> 23:40.710
Thanks for watching!
